{"path":"mainstory/episode_01/chapter_1/main_chapter01_07_01_battle_02","commands":[{"class":"NaniSummary","line":0,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"없는 도넛으로 협상하려 하다니, 괘씸죄 적용이다 이 도넛 경찰아!!","en":"Trying to bargain with donuts you don't even have? That's an extra charge for insolence, you donut cop!!","ja":"ありもしないドーナツで交渉しようだなんて、不敬罪の適用だ、このドーナツ警察め！！","zh-Hans":"竟敢用不存在的甜甜圈来谈判，我要判你个大不敬之罪，你这甜甜圈警察！！","zh-Hant":"竟然想拿根本不存在的甜甜圈來談判，這位甜甜圈警察，罪加一等！","th":"กล้าดีมาเจรจาด้วยโดนัทที่ไม่มีอยู่จริง โดนข้อหาอวดดีแน่ยัยตำรวจโดนัทเอ๋ย!!","es":"¡¿Intentar negociar con dónuts inexistentes?! ¡¡Cometes el delito de osadía, policía de los dónuts!!"}}},{"class":"ShowUI","line":2,"fields":{"UINames":"TutorialHighlightPanel"}},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":4,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_character_001","FadeInDuration":"1","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":6,"fields":{"ActorIds":"manageress"}},{"class":"CharacterAppearToLeftCommand","line":7,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress","Wait":"true","Destination":"80","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":8,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":10,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress.chat","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":11,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress","Wait":"false","Power":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":12,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress.smile","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":12,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"후후후... 너무 짜릿한걸?","texts":{"en":"Fufufu... This is so thrilling.","ja":"ふふふ…かなりゾクゾクするわね。","zh-Hans":"呵呵呵……真是太刺激了呢？","zh-Hant":"呵呵呵……這可真是太刺激了。","th":"ฮุฮุฮุ... ตื่นเต้นเสียวซ่านสุดๆ ไปเลยไม่ใช่เหรอ?","es":"Jujuju... ¡Qué emocionante!"},"author":"manageress"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":14,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"manageress.harmony","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":15,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"manageress.happy","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":15,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"manageress","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"너희 엉덩이도 잡아서 길들이는 맛이 나겠어~","texts":{"en":"Taming your butts is going to be so satisfying.","ja":"あなたたちのお尻も、捕まえて手なずける甲斐がありそうだわ～","zh-Hans":"抓住你们的屁股好好调教一番，肯定很有意思～","zh-Hant":"看來把你們的屁股也抓來好好調教一番，應該會很有意思呢～","th":"การจับพวกบั้นท้ายของพวกเธอมาสยบสั่งสอนคงจะฟินน่าดูเลยน้า~","es":"¡Va a ser todo un deleite atrapar vuestros culitos y adiestraros!~"},"author":"manageress"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":17,"fields":{}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":18,"fields":{"ActorIds":"freya"}},{"class":"CharacterAppearToRightCommand","line":19,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya.embarrassed","Wait":"true","Destination":"20","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":20,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":22,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterStiffCommand","line":24,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0","Power":"1.0","Duration":"0.10000000149011612","Count":"2"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":25,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"freya.depressed2","Volume":"1.0","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":26,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"freya","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"으, 이제 슬슬 한계인데...","texts":{"en":"Ugh, I'm reaching my limit here...","ja":"うぅ、もうそろそろ限界なんだけど…","zh-Hans":"呃，差不多快到极限了……","zh-Hant":"唔，我的體力差不多也快到極限了……","th":"อึ้ก เริ่มจะถึงขีดจำกัดแล้วสิ...","es":"Ugh, ya casi estoy al límite..."},"author":"freya"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":28,"fields":{}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":29,"fields":{"ActorIds":"theta"}},{"class":"CharacterDisappearToLeftCommand","line":30,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"freya","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterAppearToRightCommand","line":31,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"the